    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήφ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		perh. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made of marble,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθινος ἢ ψ. μυροθήκη</span> as expl.
			of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλάβαστρον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				374
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλάβαστρον: μυροθήκη λίθος
				ψήφινος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθινος ἢ ψ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cyr.
				</span></i>
			): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ Ἁρποκράτου
			ψηφίνου</span> from a <i>marble</i> (statue of) Harpocrates, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.1074
			</span></i>.</div>
